BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Ground contact on a slope</h1>
Delta-gliders dropped onto a 12 degree slope near Hadley Rille on the
Moon: braked facing uphill, braked across the slope, and unbraked facing
downhill. Needs the Moon's elevation data (skipped without it).
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 51982.6685767396
  Script Tests/ContactSlopeTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship UPHILL
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET UPHILL
  MODE Extern
  POS 4.0 -20.0 -30
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
UPHILL:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Moon
  POS 3.7400 24.5000
  HEADING 234.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
ACROSS:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Moon
  POS 3.8300 24.5000
  HEADING 323.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
DOWNHILL:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Landed Moon
  POS 3.8400 24.5000
  HEADING 46.00
  GEAR 1 1.0000
  PRPLEVEL 0:0.300 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
